---
// Proof-point stat band on ink.
---

<section class="cql-stats">
  <div class="cql-container cql-stats__grid">
    <div class="cql-stat">
      <div class="cql-stat__value">~4%</div>
      <div class="cql-stat__caption">
        mean error pricing a public API we don't own, from a 93-line adapter, quoted fully offline
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cql-stat cql-stat--aqua">
      <div class="cql-stat__value">5 / 5</div>
      <div class="cql-stat__caption">
        held-out queries where the billable ceiling was never under the real cost
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cql-stat">
      <div class="cql-stat__value">38.5×</div>
      <div class="cql-stat__caption">
        real DB coalescing observed and priced by learned batch curves at T3
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
